## Third-party notices

### Astryx (Meta Platforms, Inc.)

The layout skeletons under `templates/pages/` are derived from the page
templates of the Astryx design system, extracted via
`astryx template <name> --skeleton` at Astryx CLI 0.7.11.

- Source: https://github.com/meta/astryx
- License: MIT
- Copyright (c) 2026 Meta Platforms, Inc.

The skeletons contain only layout structure and spacing values (component
nesting, `padding`, `gap`). They contain no React source, no compiled CSS, and
no Astryx component implementations. The Astryx MIT license text is reproduced
below as required by its terms.

