### Luckymaomi UI style library

The design-style snapshot bundled at `templates/styles.json.gz` (143 styles
with AI implementation rules, tokens and Tailwind component recipes) is
derived from the luckymaomi/ui project, extracted from
`src/content/data/styles.json` on 2026-11-11.

- Source: https://github.com/luckymaomi/ui
- Site: https://luckymaomi.github.io/ui/
- License: MIT

The snapshot drops English duplicate fields and page-only metadata; all
retained content (Chinese rules, tokens, recipes) originates from that
project. Its MIT license applies to the retained data.

### Library download figures

The npm weekly download counts and GitHub star counts quoted in
`SKILL.md` and `scripts/route_stack.py` were measured in November 2026 and are
reproduced as factual measurements for selection reasoning. They are not
covered by any licence and should be re-measured before relying on them.
